"Government of India Ohm Standard Verified" to the passage of an electric current when the coil of wire, forming part of
the aforesaid instrument and connected to the aforesaid terminals is in all parts at a temperature of 300C;
(ah)
"open sparking" means sparking which owing to the lack of adequate provisions for preventing the ignition of
inflammable gas external to the apparatus would ignite such inflammable gas;
(ai)
"overhead line" means any electric supply-line which is placed above ground and in the open [air]
